    "updated_at": "2026-04-14T21:52:37Z",
    "body": "`all: unset` is a bit heavyweight, performance-wise, if we only need a couple properties to explicitly inherit, but I guess not super concerning anyhow? The difference between `all: unset` and resetting all relevant properties to `inherit` / `initial` is not observable, and the intent of `all: unset` is a bit clearer.",
